1
00:00:40,930 --> 00:00:48,800
The gun is one of humanity's greatest inventions,
born from the instinct for survival.

2
00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:04,973
Over its long history, it has
evolved as a weapon for combat,

3
00:01:04,997 --> 00:01:09,072
a hunting tool, and
a tool for shooting competition.

4
00:01:12,530 --> 00:01:16,518
Of all firearms, the handgun is
the one most closely connected

5
00:01:16,542 --> 00:01:20,542
to human senses through
its form and handling.

6
00:01:21,449 --> 00:01:25,495
At the same time, maximum power
and minimum size

7
00:01:25,519 --> 00:01:29,412
are two opposing goals
in handgun design.

8
00:01:59,089 --> 00:01:59,554
Handguns incorporate an enormous
amount of technology

9
00:01:59,578 --> 00:02:01,338
developed over the course
of their history.

10
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:21,280
Today, more than 300 models of
handgun are made around the world.

11
00:02:24,870 --> 00:02:28,658
Many are semi-automatic, using the
recoil or gas produced by firing

12
00:02:28,682 --> 00:02:32,532
