and load the next round.

13
00:02:34,330 --> 00:02:38,415
The other major type is the revolver,
which rotates a cylinder

14
00:02:38,439 --> 00:02:42,342
containing multiple cartridges
loaded in advance.

15
00:02:44,820 --> 00:02:48,753
Semi-automatic pistols offer
greater ammunition capacity

16
00:02:48,777 --> 00:02:52,782
and rapid follow-up shots, making
them the military mainstream,

17
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:59,178
while revolvers remain popular
for their simplicity

18
00:02:59,202 --> 00:03:02,972
and their ability to use different
types of ammunition reliably.

19
00:03:06,790 --> 00:03:10,656
The latest semi-automatic pistol,
the Colt All American 2000,

20
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:14,802
was introduced as Colt's
next-generation handgun.

21
00:03:15,890 --> 00:03:20,190
Its design was based on a concept by
Reed Knight, known for military firearms.

22
00:03:20,740 --> 00:03:26,780
The mechanism combines a double action-only
trigger system and manual safety.

23
00:03:40,950 --> 00:03:48,800
The unique rotary barrel locking that
locks the slide is also a major feature.

24
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:58,916
The Glock 17 mechanism,
which was a big hit in the

25
00:03:58,940 --> 00:04:02,152
American market, was
introduced as soon as possible.

26
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:09,001
Steel slide and barrel
and plastic grip frame are

27
00:04:09,025 --> 00:04:13,292
combined together to create
a new generation of handgun.

28
00:04:41,285 --> 00:04:44,934
This is a new design from the famous
Walther company,

29
00:04:44,958 --> 00:04:49,172
departing significantly from
the traditional P38 series.

30
