Since its release, various barrel
sizes have appeared, but among

45
00:07:24,853 --> 00:07:28,822
them, the 6.5-inch one is well
balanced and especially popular.

46
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:46,510
Because the stainless-steel body
is easy to maintain,

47
00:07:46,534 --> 00:07:50,152
stainless steel has become a popular
material for modern revolvers.

48
