different in length, height, and number
of rounds, but all use the same mechanism.

55
00:09:32,629 --> 00:09:36,432
The evaluation of this
series is high, and it is also

56
00:09:36,456 --> 00:09:40,342
used by the FBI and the
German anti-terror police SEK.

57
00:09:54,510 --> 00:09:58,329
In addition, the P220 is produced
under license in Japan

58
00:09:58,353 --> 00:10:02,522
and serves as a standard pistol
of the Japan Self-Defense Forces.

59
00:10:02,570 --> 00:10:10,570
Ruger's first high-capacity
semi-automatic pistol, the Ruger P85.

60
00:10:10,571 --> 00:10:13,344
It was originally developed

61
