The powerful Colt Anaconda .44 Magnum.

74
00:12:08,009 --> 00:12:15,750
Colt already offered the .357 Magnum
Python and King Cobra.

75
00:12:16,099 --> 00:12:21,490
The Anaconda entered the market in 1990.

76
00:12:24,860 --> 00:12:32,860
Its design was based in part on
the .357 Magnum King Cobra.

77
00:12:34,319 --> 00:12:38,511
The barrel features

78
00:12:38,535 --> 00:12:41,832
