79
00:13:09,310 --> 00:13:17,310
Its power places it at the top end
of Colt's revolver lineup.

80
00:13:17,834 --> 00:13:22,110
It helped further expand the
.44 Magnum boom in the United States.

81
00:13:52,560 --> 00:14:00,560
The Italian-made U.S. service pistol,
the Beretta M92F.

82
00:14:05,339 --> 00:14:09,286
In 1985, after competing against designs
from Colt, Smith & Wesson and others,

83
00:14:09,310 --> 00:14:13,202
the Beretta M92F was selected
as the U.S. military service pistol.

84
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:25,173
The combination of aluminum frame
and steel slide, and the double action

85
00:14:25,197 --> 00:14:29,332
trigger, double column magazine equipped
at the request of the American army,

86
00:14:33,190 --> 00:14:41,190
have a great influence on the
direction of modern automatic pistols.

87
00:15:11,119 --> 00:15:14,762
It is highly operational, durable
and safe, and is used by many

88
00:15:14,786 --> 00:15:18,732
countries, including Italy and
France, other than the United States.

89
00:15:45,280 --> 00:15:49,231
Therefore, the ability and
character of the gun can be

90
