of propellant it contains.

94
00:16:10,969 --> 00:16:14,330
Accordingly, the firearm
used for it also changes.

95
00:16:15,159 --> 00:16:19,303
Choosing the proper ammunition
and firearm for the intended purpose

96
00:16:19,327 --> 00:16:22,972
determines the effect
that can be delivered on target.

97
00:16:23,959 --> 00:16:27,076
Now, let's fire the same 9mm Luger
Full Metal Jacket

98
00:16:27,100 --> 00:16:30,442
