from the same gun.

99
00:16:37,794 --> 00:16:45,470
Full Metal Jacket / Hydra-Shok.

100
00:16:49,059 --> 00:16:55,010
For this test, 25 mm-thick
laminated material is used.

101
00:17:08,599 --> 00:17:12,327
The Hydra-Shok stops at the sixth layer,
while the

102
