104
00:17:52,619 --> 00:18:00,520
Full Metal Jacket ammunition has
excellent penetration.

105
00:18:00,619 --> 00:18:04,019
Hydra-Shok, on the other hand,
expands inside the target

106
00:18:04,043 --> 00:18:07,392
