powerful in all respects.

110
00:18:25,989 --> 00:18:29,748
Let's compare two Full Metal Jacket
cartridges:

111
00:18:29,772 --> 00:18:34,002
9mm Luger and .45 ACP.

112
00:18:52,669 --> 00:18:56,528
The .45 ACP stops at the fifth layer,

113
00:18:56,552 --> 00:19:00,682
