reaches the eighth layer.

114
00:19:01,219 --> 00:19:05,326
Although smaller in caliber,
the faster 9mm Luger

115
00:19:05,350 --> 00:19:09,132
offers greater penetration.

116
00:19:09,219 --> 00:19:17,120
Finally, let's compare the small
.22 Short with the .44 Magnum.

117
00:19:52,259 --> 00:20:00,060
There is a big difference in all points
of penetration and stopping power.

118
00:20:09,769 --> 00:20:14,223
Currently, there are
various types of ammunition

119
00:20:14,247 --> 00:20:17,770
