in a compact package.

127
00:21:31,659 --> 00:21:39,310
The speed and compactness
of the body are highly evaluated.

128
00:21:39,311 --> 00:21:43,800
It was officially adopted
by German police agencies.

129
00:22:01,029 --> 00:22:08,880
It is also officially adopted by the
famous anti-terrorist unit, GSG-9.

130
00:22:12,800 --> 00:22:20,800
Ruger's large double-action revolver,
the Ruger Super Redhawk.

131
00:22:20,940 --> 00:22:25,046
It is a large-frame revolver
that follows in the lineage

132
00:22:25,070 --> 00:22:28,952
of Ruger's Security-Six series,
