147
00:24:56,429 --> 00:25:01,410
It features an aluminum frame
and a steel slide combination.

148
00:25:06,729 --> 00:25:10,592
M559 with a steel frame
and M659 with all-stainless

149
00:25:10,616 --> 00:25:14,642
The steel-framed Model 559 and
