154
00:25:55,479 --> 00:26:02,810
It has an extraordinary
lightness of 650 grams.

155
00:26:13,850 --> 00:26:17,750
The slide is made of steel, but
since the center of gravity is low,

156
00:26:17,774 --> 00:26:21,862
