excellent for continuous shooting.

157
00:26:21,863 --> 00:26:26,060
It is now the official pistol
used by the Austrian army.

158
00:26:26,061 --> 00:26:32,370
Its advanced use of polymer
was sensational at the time.

159
00:26:32,371 --> 00:26:37,340
It became widely used
as a police semi-automatic pistol.

160
00:26:37,341 --> 00:26:40,957
In addition, it is highly
practical under harsh

161
00:26:40,981 --> 00:26:44,532
conditions such as cold
temperatures and rust.

162
00:26:45,080 --> 00:26:53,080
It is also used by the Norwegian army.

163
00:26:53,081 --> 00:26:57,530
The Glock 17 achieved high performance
through revolutionary ideas.

164
00:27:30,550 --> 00:27:38,550
It is one of the pistols that helped
point the way toward the future.

165
00:27:38,551 --> 00:27:43,710
The handgun was born about 600 years ago.

166
00:27:43,711 --> 00:27:48,960
Until now, many people have
repeated trial and error with their hands,

167
00:27:51,920 --> 00:27:59,920
and guns with various mechanisms
and styles have been made.

168
00:27:59,921 --> 00:28:02,880
Many of them were inspired by ideal ideas,

169
00:28:02,881 --> 00:28:07,033
and some of them were made
by combining an automatic

170
00:28:07,057 --> 00:28:10,502
