in countries including Poland, Hungary and China.

209
00:33:27,669 --> 00:33:35,420
The idea of many people is to give
various shapes and functions to handguns.

210
00:33:39,259 --> 00:33:46,210
And the history of such
evolution continues today.

211
00:34:02,229 --> 00:34:09,480
As handguns evolved to fill
increasingly specialized roles,

212
00:34:09,730 --> 00:34:13,340
