Along with an optional shoulder stock,
it has a folding foregrip

224
00:36:35,058 --> 00:36:39,110
in front of the trigger guard to improve
control during rapid fire.

225
00:36:39,111 --> 00:36:43,710
The Glock 18 looks almost identical
to the Glock 17.

